{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebound Hell: Demo immerses you in an early version of the infernal arena. Face a barrage of enemies in a unique biome and discover the bouncing bullet system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your white shots turn red as they bounce off walls, transforming into deadly traps that inflict damage if they hit you. Survive waves of enemies and use the chaos of your own projectiles to repel the invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/3c5088aa4d6760bb0c6cdaabb747cc3e.poster.avif?t=1759176625\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/3c5088aa4d6760bb0c6cdaabb747cc3e.webm?t=1759176625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/3c5088aa4d6760bb0c6cdaabb747cc3e.mp4?t=1759176625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 shots, a yellow ball appears: pick it up to choose between two random upgrades that modify your abilities. This demo features about half of the upgrades planned for the full game, giving you a taste of the many possible combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/606f0cf68d6392c23f545d90e7ede468.poster.avif?t=1759176625\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/606f0cf68d6392c23f545d90e7ede468.webm?t=1759176625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058980/extras/606f0cf68d6392c23f545d90e7ede468.mp4?t=1759176625\" type=\"video/m